So that, when they pass away; they leave us a message that is completely hundred percent pure.

508
00:39:03,568 --> 00:39:04,761
There is no mistakes in it.

509
00:39:05,568 --> 00:39:10,550
So when Sayidina Dawoodعليه السلام made a mistake in the judgment; Allahسُبحانه وتعالى corrected him.

510
00:39:10,797 --> 00:39:15,610
So Allahسُبحانه وتعالى does not leave the messengers without teaching them, the right Ijtihaad(اجتهاد).

511
00:39:16,590 --> 00:39:23,574
Therefore, whatever the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء) leave us; is hundred percent pure, infallible without any mistakes.

512
00:39:24,954 --> 00:39:30,205
And that is called Al-Ismah(العصمة); Ismat-ul-Ambiyaa(العصمة الأنبِيَاء); the infallibility of the prophets.

513
00:39:31,312 --> 00:39:40,120
The fourth quality which is unique about the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء) of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى; their soul is never taken until, till they give permission.

514
00:39:41,134 --> 00:39:42,740
For us; our death is unannounced.

515
00:39:43,114 --> 00:39:49,986
The Angel of Death, when he comes to you; he's not going to seek your permission, he's not going to knock on your door and say, can you please allow me in.

516
00:39:50,566 --> 00:39:53,333
He's going to come, take it whether you like it or not.

517
00:39:53,713 --> 00:39:59,501
With the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء) of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى; the Angel of Death comes to them, and seeks their permission first,

518
00:39:59,759 --> 00:40:02,318
 and tells them that, I have came to take your soul.

519
00:40:02,698 --> 00:40:04,545
Rasool Allah ﷺ says in the Hadith(حديث);

520
00:40:04,685 --> 00:40:09,430
ما من نبي يمرض إلا خير بين الدنيا والآخرة

521
00:40:10,343 --> 00:40:14,668
Rasool Allah ﷺ says; Any prophet who becomes ill; and this is the illness of death.

522
00:40:15,242 --> 00:40:19,549
Any prophet who becomes ill; he is given the choice of Duniyah(دُنِيَّا) or Akhirah(آخرة).

523
00:40:20,149 --> 00:40:20,628
They choose.

524
00:40:20,721 --> 00:40:23,841
And this Hadith(حديث) is narrated by Al Bukhari Wa Mulim(البخاريْ ومسلم).

525
00:40:24,141 --> 00:40:25,021
Number five;

526
00:40:25,255 --> 00:40:26,402
يقبر حيث يموت

527
00:40:26,495 --> 00:40:29,248
Every prophet is buried exactly the spot they die.

528
00:40:29,668 --> 00:40:31,394
They're not carried from one place to another.

529
00:40:31,748 --> 00:40:33,114
Rasool Allah ﷺ says;

530
00:40:33,374 --> 00:40:37,224
لن يُقبَرَ نبيٌّ إلَّا حيثُ يموتُ

531
00:40:37,504 --> 00:40:39,757
Narrated by Al Imam Ahmad(الاِمَامْ اَحْمَدْ), Rasool Allah ﷺ says;

532
00:40:40,104 --> 00:40:43,326
Every prophet is buried in the spot they die.

533
00:40:44,112 --> 00:40:45,366
Number six;

534
00:40:46,132 --> 00:40:51,491
The earth does not decompose their bodies, and eat away their bodies.

535
00:40:52,118 --> 00:40:54,998
The bodies of the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء) are protected in their graves.

536
00:40:55,838 --> 00:41:02,764
And the animals, and the insects of the earth, and the erosion caused by earth, does not affect their bodies.

537
00:41:04,137 --> 00:41:10,606
Rasool Allah ﷺ says in the Hadith(حديث) narrated by Abu Daud Wan-Nisai(أبوداؤد والنّسائى) and Abu Khuzaimah(ابو خزيمه) has said, it is Sahih(صحيح);

538
00:41:11,113 --> 00:41:14,128
إنَّ اللهَ حرَّم على الأرضِ أن تأكلَ أجسادَ الأنبياءِ

539
00:41:14,828 --> 00:41:19,914
Allah Has made it Haram(حرام) on the earth to eat away from the bodies of the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء).

540
00:41:20,647 --> 00:41:23,634
The body of the Nabi(نَبِي) is just like, when he was alive.

541
00:41:24,160 --> 00:41:30,632
It does not go through the natural process of decomposing that we are susceptible to.

542
00:41:31,279 --> 00:41:38,271
The Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء) of  Allahسُبحانه وتعالى; Allah as an honoring for them; preserves their bodies in their graves, wherever they are.

543
00:41:39,631 --> 00:41:40,754
Finally, number seven;

544
00:41:41,001 --> 00:41:43,267
They are alive in their graves.

545
00:41:43,727 --> 00:41:46,714
Rasool Allah ﷺ says in the Hadith(حديث) narrated by Al-Jama'ah(الجماعة);

546
00:41:46,881 --> 00:41:49,737
الأنبياء أحياء في قبورهم يصلون

547
00:41:50,390 --> 00:41:54,518
Rasool Allah ﷺ says; The prophets are alive in their graves and praying.

548
00:41:56,178 --> 00:41:59,638
We're done with the lives of the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء) of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى.

549
00:41:59,712 --> 00:42:05,088
And Allahسُبحانه وتعالى Has made for us in the lives of the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء) of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى Ibrah(عبرة).

550
00:42:05,588 --> 00:42:09,659
And again, we need to remember what is the purpose of these stories?

551
00:42:09,866 --> 00:42:10,412
It is;

552
00:42:10,626 --> 00:42:12,883
لَقَدْ كَانَ فِي قَصَصِهِمْ عِبْرَةٌ

553
00:42:13,223 --> 00:42:18,619
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says; In their stories are lessons; Ibrah(عبرة); lessons for you.

554
00:42:18,832 --> 00:42:25,026
We ask Allahسُبحانه وتعالى to make us of those, who would follow the lessons of the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء) of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى.

555
00:42:25,286 --> 00:42:33,131
We ask Allahسُبحانه وتعالى to accept our deeds of coming here, and talking about of Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء) of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى.

556
00:42:33,385 --> 00:42:36,625
And we ask Allahسُبحانه وتعالى to make us of those, who would love the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء) of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى

557
00:42:36,645 --> 00:42:40,194
because; if we love them; we will be resurrected with them on the day of judgment.

558
00:42:40,367 --> 00:42:43,501
ونسئلك ان تجعلنا ممن يحب انبياءك

559
00:42:43,787 --> 00:42:49,900
We ask Allahسُبحانه وتعالى to make us of those who love, deeply love, sincerely love the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء) of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى.

